{
  "comment": "Cloud provider presets (data file: revise per release, no code change needed). Each preset's baseUrl is what the OpenAI- or Anthropic-format provider is pointed at; pinned are 2-4 chat models shown under Recommended, first one available becomes the default. lastVerified is the date the base URL and pinned ids were checked against the provider's official docs. exclude_patterns are case-insensitive regexes applied to model ids when the endpoint supplies no capability metadata; a matching id is never shown as a chat model or auto-selected. Custom presets take a user-supplied base URL.",
